  "contract": [
    "CatalogState carries catalog identity, payload checksum, and authority head under one read lock. It reads no storage and allocates zero times in the measured read assertion.",
    "Source selection, origin publication, retained restart, and failed replacement preserve the catalog/head binding. Ordinary reconciliation clears upstream authority.",
    "The snapshot identifies its publication. It does not authenticate an authority, renew permission, or establish fleet freshness. Starport must retain it and check current permission per attempt and cache delivery."
  ],
